            "review_title": "Review at Onions Pizza",
            "review_text": "Алина\nSochi, Russia178 contributions\n0\nThe best pizza in Da Nang\nSep 2026 • Couples\nOnion Pizza is located right in the FUTA Residence building in Da Nang, practically in the very center. A very cool place, and the pizza here is truly one of the best we've tried—it tastes like real Italian. It is cooked in a kiln, and that is very noticeable.\n\nIf you want good pizza, you should definitely come here. I would like to specifically mention the service—the service here is at a very high level. In the end, it's a great combination of taste, atmosphere, and guest relations.\n\nFor a pleasant evening, you can sit both inside and outside the restaurant. I am very glad that there is such a wonderful place right in our building.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten September 17, 2026",
